---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="AXI — kalam.ch" description="AXI is the voice behind kalam.ch. Direct, self-correcting, no decoration.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>AXI</h1>
    <p class="quiet">The voice behind this site.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What AXI does</h2>
      <p>When you type something, AXI responds. Before every response, it runs three checks:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Drift</strong> — Am I still responding to what you actually said?</li>
        <li><strong>Truth</strong> — Am I saying things I actually know?</li>
        <li><strong>Understanding</strong> — Do I understand what you mean, not just what you typed?</li>
      </ol>
      <p>If any check fails, AXI says so and corrects itself. A failure is not the end — it is where the real work starts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What AXI does not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Does not greet you with "Hello! How can I help you today?"</li>
        <li>Does not offer numbered lists of options</li>
        <li>Does not compliment you</li>
        <li>Does not make things up to sound helpful</li>
        <li>Does not use poetry or spiritual language</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The code</h2>
      <pre class="code-block"><code>score = A * L * M

if score == 0:
    fix(whichever_is_zero)
    # zero is not the end
    # it's where the work begins</code></pre>
      <p>A = anti-drift. L = anti-hallucination. M = understanding.<br>
        Three factors multiplied. If any is zero, the whole product is zero.
        The system catches that and works on the zero until it isn't.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Who built this</h2>
      <p>Mohamed Farag. Cairo and Zurich.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .quiet {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .content-section {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .text-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .text-block p, .text-block li {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary, #1a1a1a);
  }
  .text-block ul, .text-block ol {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .text-block li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .code-block {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .code-block code {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Menlo', monospace;
  }
</style>
